# No content reuse

Before creating a still, story, or picking a background video, check what is already used.

1. Run `python scripts/content_reuse.py list` or read `content/used.json`.
2. Stories: new title, hook, and plot. Do not rewrite Don't Go Inside, 4C, the roommate camera story, or anything else in the catalog.
3. Photos: new subject/setting slug. Do not regenerate or overwrite an existing still in `prompts/dark-luxury-still/`.
4. Videos: do not re-download or re-cut a YouTube id already in the catalog.
5. After creating something new, run `python scripts/content_reuse.py rebuild`.

```
python scripts/content_reuse.py check-story --title "..." --hook "..." --text "..."
python scripts/content_reuse.py check-photo --slug "new-slug" --subject "subject setting"
python scripts/content_reuse.py check-video --youtube-id "xxxxxxxxxxx"
```

If a check exits 2, change the idea. Do not pass `--allow-reuse` unless the user asked to remake that piece.
